{
  "abstract": "The exact two-colour book Ramsey number R(B5,B9) is 29. The proof combines a 28-vertex explicit colouring, degree and deficit identities, a finite degree classification, and elimination of all surviving 29-vertex cases. The formal statement asserts the least order forcing a red five-page or blue nine-page book. Originality is not independently confirmed.",
